# Local verification builds. Existing tracked release artifacts are preserved.
/build/

# Intermediate build output. Untracked 2026-09-04: 29 files of .obj, .tlog,
# .iobj, .recipe and compiler .pdb that every build rewrote, so the tree was
# dirty after any compile and diffs were unreviewable. The shipped binary at
# x64/Release/ stays tracked; only the intermediates that produce it are gone.
# They remain in history if an old build ever needs reconstructing.
/MIDI++/x64/

# 20MB of debug symbols against a 1MB executable, and the largest thing in the
# repository. The executable is what people download; symbols are rebuildable.
/x64/Release/MIDI++.pdb

# Stray MSBuild output. A /p:OutDir given as a relative path resolves against
# the project directory, not the repository root, which put a 20MB pdb here.
/MIDI++/build/

# Task prompts handed between the two assistants working this repo. They are
# written to the repository root so the other one can actually read them, and
# they are notes to a collaborator rather than part of the project.
/sol-prompt*.md
/claude-prompt*.md
